  "$comment": "Zenburn. Source: https://github.com/jnurmine/Zenburn. Licence: values-only (GPL header, no LICENSE file). Deliberately low contrast: muted #9fafaf (comment green is 3.6:1 → disabled), success text lifted to #9bb195, purple text #ec93d3; inset, border and darker steps derived.",
